   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Image Â©Licensed to i-Images Picture Agency. 07/11/2019. London, United Kingdom. Boris Johnson General Election Camapign Day Two. Britain's Prime Minister Boris Johnson visits Roseisle Distillery in Elgin, Scotland, on Day Two of his 2019 General Election Campaign. Picture by Andrew Parsons / i-Images</rdf:li>
