   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Newly elected leader of the Conservative party Boris Johnson leaves his office in Westminster, London, after it was announced he had won the leadership ballot and will become the next Prime Minister.</rdf:li>
